This is device-pool contention on a shared host with 4+ concurrent /new-task sessions, not
evidence against the fix itself. The AVD-level fix (PlayStore.enabled=yes, cold-booted, Play
Services packages present) is independently confirmed via docs/data-qa/verification-checks.md's
own adb-level verification (pm list packages showing com.android.vending +
